WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.402
In this video, you will see how to feature an event, or a winning home, with a gold pin on the map.

00:00:06.402 --> 00:00:09.824
We go as far as the secure payment page, and stop there.

00:00:09.824 --> 00:00:11.024
We start on the map.

00:00:11.925 --> 00:00:15.987
To begin, open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:15.987 --> 00:00:18.112
That is the only address you need.

00:00:19.934 --> 00:00:22.341
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:22.341 --> 00:00:26.085
The first time you visit, it asks to use your location.

00:00:26.085 --> 00:00:27.422
Tap Use my location.

00:00:29.212 --> 00:00:33.650
That is how the map shows how far things are, and gives you directions.

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:36.854
Your browser asks permission as well, so tap Allow.

00:00:36.854 --> 00:00:41.415
Your location is used only on your device, and you can say no at any time.

00:00:44.938 --> 00:00:48.309
Look at the top right corner of the map, and tap the three dots.

00:00:49.912 --> 00:00:52.294
In the menu, tap Promote your event.

00:00:52.294 --> 00:00:54.418
Listing an event is always free.

00:00:54.418 --> 00:00:57.443
This is for organizers who want a Featured pin.

00:00:59.409 --> 00:01:08.414
This list shows what you can feature: events you added, contests you run, and homes that finished first, second or third in an announced contest.

00:01:08.414 --> 00:01:10.758
Paying never changes a contest result.

00:01:11.661 --> 00:01:13.261
Tap your event, to feature it.

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:16.139
Now pick a plan.

00:01:16.139 --> 00:01:22.621
Each plan lists what you get and how long it runs, and each is a one time payment, with no subscription.

00:01:22.621 --> 00:01:27.868
A Featured event gets a gold ringed pin on the map, and a Featured badge in the list.

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:30.028
Tap the plan you want.

00:01:31.753 --> 00:01:33.701
Then tap Continue to payment.

00:01:33.701 --> 00:01:38.638
This opens Stripe's secure page, where you pay with a card or Cash App Pay.

00:01:38.638 --> 00:01:44.809
We stop here, because this is only a demonstration, and we never enter card details in a video.

00:01:47.112 --> 00:01:53.471
After you pay, your gold pin turns on by itself, within a few minutes, and a receipt arrives by email.

00:01:53.471 --> 00:01:58.163
Winning homes work the same way: tap the home in this list, and pick a plan.

00:01:59.070 --> 00:02:02.310
That is how you feature an event or a winning home.

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:06.110
Listing is always free, and Featured is the only paid option.

00:02:07.514 --> 00:02:09.520
Next up: Find lights near you.
